```
##### &emsp;&emsp;&emsp;```_IO_switch_to_wget_mode```, 又到了```_IO_WOVERFLOW()```, 
```c
_IO_switch_to_wget_mode (FILE *fp)
{
  if (fp->_wide_data->_IO_write_ptr > fp->_wide_data->_IO_write_base)
    if ((wint_t)_IO_WOVERFLOW (fp, WEOF) == WEOF)
      return EOF;
    ...
    ...
    ...
